      "id": "18069",
      "key": "SFCC-83",
      "summary": "Recently Viewed UI Component (Shared)",
      "description": "As a \nShopper, \n\n\nI want\n to see a list of products I've recently browsed,\n\n\nso that\n I can easily return to items I was considering without having to search for them again.\nReference image (Figma is leading):\nRecently Viewed is a shared PWA component that renders a horizontal rail of product tiles based on the customer's browsing history. It is built once and reused across multiple page contexts. Confirmed surfaces are PLP, PDP, and Cart. Additional surfaces are pending the designs.\nBrowsing history storage:\nFor \nguest shoppers\n: history is stored temporarily. It persists for the duration of that session only.\nFor \nauthenticated shoppers\n: history persisted cross-session — stored against the customer account so it survives browser close and is available on login from any device.",
