    },
    "version": 4,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "This page consolidates all open questions for the Global-R team relevant to the Zimmermann SFCC / PWA integration design. Where an answer is already known from existing documentation, it is pre-filled and flagged for **confirmation only**. Questions that are not Global-E's responsibility have been removed.\n\n**Legend:** - ✅ **Known** — answer pre-filled from existing documentation; Global-E to confirm - ❓ **Unknown** — no answer exists in any page; Global-E to answer\n\n---\n\nSummary of Questions\n--------------------\n\n| **#** | **Domain** | **Question** | **Raised By** | **What we need** | **Priority** | **Response** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Q1 | PWA | Implementation details for Checkout iframe | Hardi | A Zimmermann-specific implementation details, so we can get details like the `frame-src` (for CSP, for different environments if applicable), `postMessage` schema etc. |  |  |\n| Q2 | SFCC | Retail Rewards redemption at Checkout | Jasmijn | Confirm whether global-e can support AP21 retail rewards redemption in international checkouts - limitation today | Medium |  |\n| Q3 | SFCC | Shipping Country lock at Checkout | Jasmijn | Confirm whether global-e locks shipping country in Checkout (The requirement is: The system will lock the shipping country in the Global-e checkout for international orders. The shipping country is determined by the customer's country selector selection prior to checkout entry and cannot be changed within the Global-e checkout flow. To change their shipping country, the customer must return to the storefront and update their country selector selection.) | Medium |  |\n| Q4 |  |  |  |  |  |  |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "emoji": "2753",
    "page_width": "fixed-width"
  }
}"}

