{"result":"{
  "metadata": {
    "id": "258801666",
    "title": "04.2 Design Tracker",
    "type": "page",
    "created": "",
    "updated": "",
    "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SFCC/pages/258801666",
    "space": {
      "key": "SFCC",
      "name": "Adobe SFCC"
    },
    "version": 44,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "This page tracks design deliverables required from the design team based on approved business and functional requirements. Phase 1 designs are mostly done by now (June). Phase 2 designs are work in progress and planned to be done by mid-July 2026. We will update **Design Status**, **Accenture Review**, and **Zimmermann Sign-off** in our weekly meetings with the design team.\n\n**How to use this tracker**  \nThis table is organized by functional area where priority is mostly based on the build order. We will add final designs through Figma links in the **Figma Link** column as designs are available, and capture unresolved questions, dependencies, or missing states in **Notes / Open Items**.\n\n| **Prio** | **Epic** | **Component** | **Component Detail** | **Sprint** | **Figma Link** | **Design Status** | **Zimmermann Sign-off** | **Accenture Notes / Open Items** | **Zimmermann Feedback** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Images** | Thumbnails, hero image, flatlay/model/video (incl. Vimeo support) | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **25-06:** mostly lead with video but option to change that. video, flatlay, then 2-4 images (want to AB test # of images) would like to see design with 4 below the 2 big ones  **30-06:** # of large versus smaller pictures needs to be flexible - needs to work for the product (e.g. runway product may need more images) - logic depends on the # of pictures we have - combination of close ups and zoomed out. Runway has certain logic - and perhaps category on top of that. Pause button on videos |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Image Gallery** | When customer clicks to view more images | Sprint 1-2 |  | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **25-06:** version of it with swatches - previously presented by Jojo - Zimm wants to see this again  **30-06:** Remove model wearing copy. Then we can put colors there “also available in” underline selected color, name not needed in gallery). Prefer the full page gallery with bigger images - the color swatches for especially bags relevant. max colors? 6 seems to be most  **01-07:** Circle swatch of the actual fabric + color name appears when hovered  For mobile: remove “1/6” counter of images  **02-07:** Signed off |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Product Info** | Product name, description, breadcrumb navigation, | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  | **30-06:** Model wears…size. and include ‘runs true to size’ text as well  **01-07:** Align the width of model text to the product description on top |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Badges** | Product badges (multi-badge priority, configurable display order); badge states: Campaign, Runway, Exclusive, Online Exclusive, VIC Exclusive | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DoneGreen | Signed OFfGreen |  | **01-07:** not loving the dark square around it - maybe the text in the box less dark - text a bit finer, less bold  **02-07:** need a hover state to make it clear its clickable. Outline of the box a little bit heavier |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Colour & Size Selection** | Colour swatches incl. \"also/only available in\" logic, colour swatch hover-preview; size selector with swatch states (available, low stock, greyed/unavailable); | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | DONEGreen | SIGNED OFFGreen |  |  |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Measmerize** |  |  | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | Do benchmarking and reskin it but for launch we do like for like | **30-06**: Find your size when hover - shows line.  Dani to consider Measmerize follow up - when they return the recommened size - today it just changes the size on PDP but instead play it back to the client  **01-07:** Move “Find your size” up to align with Size, and then it underlines once you hover over it  Need to A/B Test this to make sure that it’s prominent enough  **07-07:** Dani shared email from Measmerize on advice for find your size |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Price & Stock** | Price display (was/now strikethrough); low stock indicator; DDP/DDU duties messaging | Sprint 1-2 | [Design Workspace – Figma](https://www.figma.com/design/XWz3ItpkSqL45P5IFOnQgB/Design-Workspace?node-id=2262-64596&p=f&t=g8I7NUuCTCi1XfRa-0) | PENDINGYellow | PendingYellow | **23-06:** Was/now price missing from Figma. Can't find low stock indicator. DDP/DDU messaging not found — action on Jasmijn to locate screenshot | **02-07:** Charmaine to put was/now on PDP. Haven’t decided on the color - waiting on Jon to come back on this, need a nice green and red - aesthetic of the store color  **07-07:** color still open |\n| 1 | [Product Detail Page](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-5) | **Primary CTAs** | Add to Bag CTA; product availability states (In Stock, Low Stock, Coming Soon, Back in Soon, Unavailable); Notify Me modal (multi-size select); Find in Boutique slide-out